# ScrapeBadger

> Credit-based web scraping APIs for Twitter/X (including real-time streams), Reddit, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Amazon, eBay, Walmart, Etsy, AliExpress, Target, ASOS, Best Buy, Vinted, Depop, Wallapop, Gumtree, Google (18 products), Bing, Yahoo, DuckDuckGo, Yandex, real estate (Zillow, Redfin, Realtor, Apartments.com, Idealista, Immobiliare, LoopNet, Leboncoin), and any URL via the general Web Scraping API. One API key, REST + official SDKs for 12 languages (Python, Node.js/TypeScript, Go, Rust, PHP, C#, Java, Kotlin, Ruby, Swift, Dart, C++) + CLI + a hosted MCP server with 510 tools (latest MCP spec, 2026-07-28). 1,000 free credits on signup, no credit card required.

All endpoints live under `https://scrapebadger.com/v1/*` and authenticate with an API key. Machine-readable references: this file's companion [llms-full.txt](https://scrapebadger.com/llms-full.txt) lists every endpoint, and the documentation site publishes its own [docs llms.txt](https://docs.scrapebadger.com/llms.txt) with per-page markdown.

## Docs

