## Products

- [Web Scraping API](https://scrapebadger.com/web-scraping-api): Scrape any URL with JS rendering, anti-bot bypass, PNG screenshots, and CSS/XPath or AI-powered structured extraction
- [Twitter/X Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/twitter-scraper): Profiles, tweets, search, trends, followers, communities, lists, and spaces without rate limits
- [Twitter Streams](https://scrapebadger.com/twitter-streams): Real-time tweet monitoring with filter rules, webhooks, and delivery logs
- [Reddit Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/reddit-scraper): Post search, subreddit feeds, comment trees, user profiles, and trending content
- [Instagram Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/instagram-scraper): Public profiles, posts, media detail and comments — no Instagram login required. Authenticated endpoints (stories, followers/following, related profiles, hashtags, search, locations, audio, oEmbed, likers) are temporarily unavailable.
- [TikTok Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/tiktok-scraper): Profiles, videos, comments, transcripts, hashtags, sounds, search, trending, and the ad library across 20+ regions
- [YouTube Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/youtube-scraper): 39 endpoints for videos, channels, playlists, comments, transcripts, and search — no YouTube API key or quota
- [Ecommerce Scraper APIs](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api): Hub for the Amazon, eBay, Walmart, Etsy, AliExpress, Target, ASOS, Best Buy, Vinted, Depop, Wallapop, Leboncoin, Gumtree, Etsy, AliExpress, Target, ASOS and Best Buy APIs, plus Amazon price, Amazon review and Walmart price pages
- [Amazon Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/amazon): Products, offers, reviews, bestsellers, deals, and sellers across 20 marketplaces
- [eBay Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/ebay): Active and completed/sold listings, search by image, item detail, and seller data across 18 marketplaces
- [Walmart Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/walmart): US product search, category browse, deals/rollbacks, full product detail with UPC and specs, the complete review star histogram, marketplace seller catalogues, and physical-store detail with per-department hours
- [Google Play Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/google-play-scraper): Play Store app search, full listing detail with the complete rating histogram, token-paged user reviews, declared Android permissions, similar apps, developer portfolios and category charts across 40+ countries and 17+ languages
- [Apple App Store Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/app-store-scraper): App Store search, full listing detail with both lifetime and current-version ratings, customer reviews, developer portfolios and Top Free / Top Paid / Top Grossing charts on every country storefront
- [Google Ads Transparency](https://scrapebadger.com/google-scraper-api/ads-transparency): Every ad an advertiser runs across Search, Maps, Play, Shopping and YouTube — creative detail, brand-to-advertiser-id lookup, and the political spend and impression ranges Google discloses
- [Vinted Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/vinted): Marketplace search, item details, seller profiles, and brands across 26 markets
- [Yandex Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/yandex-scraper): Web search, image search, and reverse image search by URL on the Russian/international search engine, across 6 markets (Turkey default)
- [Google Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/google-scraper): 18 Google products — SERP, Maps, News, Trends, Jobs, Shopping, Hotels, Flights, Scholar, Patents, Lens, Finance, AI Mode, and more
- [Bing Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/bing-scraper): Bing web search (organic results, ads, related searches), image search, video search, news search, and query autocomplete across 30+ markets
- [Yahoo Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/yahoo-scraper): Yahoo web search (organic results, ads, related searches), image search, video search, news search, and query autocomplete across 35+ regional markets (Yahoo Japan not covered)
- [Baidu Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/baidu-scraper): China's #1 search engine — web SERP, news, images, and autocomplete, with the REAL target URL on every result instead of Baidu's /link?url= redirect
- [Naver Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/naver-scraper): South Korea's #1 search engine — web search, news, blog, autocomplete, local/Place detail and reviews, plus shopping search, bestsellers and trends, SmartStore stores and reviews, and Shopping Live — 55 endpoints under /v1/naver/*
- [DuckDuckGo Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/duckduckgo-scraper): web, image, news and video search results, search autocomplete and Instant Answers from the privacy-first search engine — region-targeted, no API key required
