- [Booking.com Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/booking-scraper): Hotel and stay search with live prices and availability for your dates, destination autocomplete, full property detail with facilities, house rules and photos, every room type with its full live rate table, and paginated guest reviews — worldwide, any currency
- [LoopNet Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/loopnet-scraper): Commercial real estate — listings, cap rates, brokers across US, CA, UK, FR, ES
- [Leboncoin Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/leboncoin): France's #1 classifieds site — ads, sellers, categories, and locations
- [Gumtree Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/gumtree): Classifieds in the UK (gumtree.com), Australia (gumtree.com.au) and South Africa (gumtree.co.za) — listing search by keyword, category, location and radius with category filters and live counts, full listing detail with the vehicle spec for cars, seller profiles and inventories, and per-market category/location trees
- [Depop Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/depop): Second-hand fashion marketplace — product search, product & shop detail, and seller listings across the global catalog
- [Wallapop Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/ecommerce-scraper-api/wallapop): Spain's most-used second-hand marketplace — listing search with price, condition, brand, distance and car filters, listing detail, seller profiles, listings and reviews, categories and filters across Spain, Italy and Portugal
- [LinkedIn Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/linkedin-scraper): Job search & detail, company and school profiles, member profiles, posts, articles, and courses — no LinkedIn account or login required
- [Facebook Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/facebook-scraper): Marketplace listings (search, category browse, item detail), search across pages/people/groups/posts/places/events, Page and profile detail with timelines, group feeds, post detail and comments, and the Ad Library — ad search & detail, advertiser page search, advertiser page info (category, followers, page transparency, managing organization, admin-account locations, ad spend), and EU/UK ad transparency insights (payer/beneficiary, reach and targeting breakdowns) — no Facebook login or Graph API token required Global keyword search is temporarily unavailable.
- [ChatGPT Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/chatgpt-scraper): Send a prompt to the real chatgpt.com and get structured JSON — answer, citations anchored to character offsets in the answer, the full search trail, and brand-visibility (AEO/GEO) analysis; no OpenAI account or API key required
- [Perplexity Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/perplexity-scraper): Send a prompt to the real perplexity.ai and get structured JSON — answer, citations anchored to character offsets in the answer, the full search trail, the retrieval fan-out (search_queries), related questions, and brand-visibility (AEO/GEO) analysis; no Perplexity account or API key required
- [Gemini Scraper](https://scrapebadger.com/gemini-scraper): Send a prompt to the real Gemini and get structured JSON — answer, cited web sources, and brand-visibility (AEO/GEO) analysis; anonymous, no Google account or API key required

