## Connect

- [MCP Server](https://scrapebadger.com/mcp): Hosted Model Context Protocol server at `https://mcp.scrapebadger.com/mcp` with 510 tools; speaks the latest MCP spec (2026-07-28) plus all earlier revisions; setup guides for Claude, Cursor, Windsurf, Gemini, and ChatGPT; OAuth 2.1 or API-key (Bearer header) auth
- [SDKs](https://scrapebadger.com/sdks): 12 official SDKs generated from one OpenAPI spec, always in sync with the API — Python (`pip install scrapebadger`), Node.js/TypeScript (`npm install scrapebadger`), Go (`go get github.com/scrape-badger/scrapebadger-go`), Rust (`cargo add scrapebadger-sdk`), PHP (`composer require scrape-badger/scrapebadger-php`), C#/.NET (`dotnet add package ScrapeBadger`), Java (`com.scrapebadger:scrapebadger` on Maven Central), Kotlin (`com.scrapebadger:scrapebadger-kotlin`), Ruby (`gem install scrapebadger`), Swift (SPM `scrape-badger/scrapebadger-swift`), Dart/Flutter (`dart pub add scrapebadger`), and C++ (source releases)
- [CLI](https://docs.scrapebadger.com/cli/overview): `pip install scrapebadger-cli` (command: `scrapebadger`; one-shot run: `uvx --from scrapebadger-cli scrapebadger`) — terminal access built for AI agents and automation: JSON/CSV/table/markdown output, field selection, pipe-friendly (`jq`) chaining; auth via `SCRAPEBADGER_API_KEY`
- [Integrations](https://scrapebadger.com/integrations): n8n workflow nodes and other automation platforms
- [Dashboard](https://scrapebadger.com/dashboard?utm_source=llms.txt): API keys, usage, billing ([sign up](https://scrapebadger.com/auth/signup?utm_source=llms.txt) for 1,000 free credits)

